                <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:border-[#f97316] hover:text-[#f97316] transition-colors shadow-sm" href="/service-areas/port-st-lucie/fire-damage-restoration/">Port St. Lucie</a>
                <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:border-[#f97316] hover:text-[#f97316] transition-colors shadow-sm" href="/service-areas/coral-gables/fire-damage-restoration/">Coral Gables</a>
                <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:border-[#f97316] hover:text-[#f97316] transition-colors shadow-sm" href="/service-areas/delray-beach/fire-damage-restoration/">Delray Beach</a>
