                <a class="px-4 py-2 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:border-[#f97316] hover:text-[#f97316] transition-colors shadow-sm" href="/service-areas/largo/fire-damage-restoration/">Largo</a>
